[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="WinScreen" unique_id=1164173546]
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 192.0
offset_top = 223.0
offset_right = 1090.0
offset_bottom = 517.0
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("10_folder")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 48
text = "Resolution

In the morning, Elena received the weekly groceries. Afterward, she went upstairs to clean the master suite alone and unsupervised. She used this opportunity to remove Otávio's auto-injectors, ensuring no immediate medical assistance would be possible if the plan succeeded.
In the afternoon, she went to the kitchen to pick up the dishes prepared by John and the unopened bottle of wine. On her way to the wine cellar, she used the corkscrew to remove the cork. Moments earlier, however, she had applied a small amount of almond oil to the inner thread of the tool, ensuring the contaminant would be transferred to the wine during extraction.
Confident that the residue was virtually undetectable, she made no effort to hide the corkscrew, leaving it in the kitchen sink after use, just as she would on any ordinary day.
She served dinner to Otávio and Pedro in the wine cellar. After finishing the service, she collected the tray and utensils and went to take out the kitchen trash, disposing of the oil bottle along with it 

"
horizontal_alignment = 1

